  "notes": "Cash basis city: one governmental fund (General Fund; Statement of Receipts, Disbursements and Changes in Fund Balance p4, balance sheet p3) and one proprietary fund (Combined Utilities Fund, accrual statements pp5-7; measure net position). Business-type receipts/disbursements from the proprietary Statement of Revenues, Expenses and Changes in Net Position (p6), the same figures the Statement of Activities (p2) uses (it nets interest income/expense to (182) and shows Other expense as Miscellaneous (13,388)); business-type receipts total from the p8 Combined Utilities column (3,627,933). Governmental beginning cash not printed (no prior-year balance sheet); ending cash = Cash in Bank + Cash at County Treasurer (p3), investments 719,227 separate; fund balance roll-forward 341,289 -> 126,429. Proprietary cash flows (p7) include loan proceeds 3,435,616 and principal payments 395,058 (capital and related financing). Balance sheet: governmental lines from the governmental funds balance sheet (p3, ties to the Statement of Net Position governmental column 126,429), business-type lines and totals from the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: the all-funds Budgetary Comparison Schedule (p8) by fund column (General Fund, Combined Utilities Fund); budget is printed only for the Totals column so budget_final is null; transfers printed net. Read pages 1-8 of 8"
